{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/a63c9cce525fdbfa8137de4d0e90ac1d.webp?t=1761095671\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/a63c9cce525fdbfa8137de4d0e90ac1d.poster.avif?t=1761095671\" class=\"bb_img\" width=72 height=150 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>\u00a0 \u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/04e97f4d35e7bfd9ee7fe04f44fe7239.avif?t=1761095671\" width=197 height=150 /></span><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/8819a21281b2a9c01d0f4f6c19f49231.webp?t=1761095671\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/8819a21281b2a9c01d0f4f6c19f49231.poster.avif?t=1761095671\" class=\"bb_img\" width=72 height=150 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 You take control of a  cat lost in an unknown world. Armed only with your bow, you'll face precision-based challenges, solve environmental puzzles, and battle strange creatures that inhabit this mysterious place. Your journey will take you through neon-lit forests, energy-powered factories, forgotten cities, and other vibrant environments. All of this is accompanied by an immersive soundtrack with a distinct vibe that enhances the atmosphere and rhythm of the adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/eeea6a23b79c1fffb0f3e9f23d5f0c39.poster.avif?t=1761095671\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/eeea6a23b79c1fffb0f3e9f23d5f0c39.webm?t=1761095671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/eeea6a23b79c1fffb0f3e9f23d5f0c39.mp4?t=1761095671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, shoot, and avoid deadly obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your bow to fire arrows, calculating force and trajectory to solve puzzles and open new paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face enemies using your bow strategically, combining precision and timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break false walls to discover collectibles and unlock new content.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/118168cec5a098be17f91b932b9145f6.poster.avif?t=1761095671\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/118168cec5a098be17f91b932b9145f6.webm?t=1761095671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/118168cec5a098be17f91b932b9145f6.mp4?t=1761095671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/0ebb891649d8cd97ca0600bcb8ccb212.poster.avif?t=1761095671\" width=150 height=99 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/0ebb891649d8cd97ca0600bcb8ccb212.webm?t=1761095671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/0ebb891649d8cd97ca0600bcb8ccb212.poster.avif?t=1761095671\" width=150 height=99 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/0ebb891649d8cd97ca0600bcb8ccb212.webm?t=1761095671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/0ebb891649d8cd97ca0600bcb8ccb212.poster.avif?t=1761095671\" width=150 height=99 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/0ebb891649d8cd97ca0600bcb8ccb212.webm?t=1761095671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/0ebb891649d8cd97ca0600bcb8ccb212.poster.avif?t=1761095671\" width=150 height=99 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/0ebb891649d8cd97ca060